Running Mocha tests


  AssetFactory
    - deploys with correct admin address
    - admin can authorise an issuer
    - admin can deauthorise an issuer
    - non-admin cannot authorise an issuer
    - authorised issuer can create an asset (deploys AssetToken + AssetSale)
    - created asset is recorded in assets array and tokenToSale mapping
    - unauthorised address cannot create an asset
    - createAsset with priceWei == 0 reverts
    - createAsset with supply == 0 reverts
    - issuer A cannot whitelist investors on issuer B's token

  AssetSale
    - deploys with correct token, priceWei, and issuer
    - issuer can allocate tokens (approve + allocate)
    - non-issuer cannot allocate
    - allocate with insufficient issuer balance reverts
    - whitelisted investor can buy tokens with exact ETH payment
    - buy with wrong ETH amount reverts
    - buy when not whitelisted reverts
    - buy more than available inventory reverts
    - issuer can withdraw ETH proceeds after a purchase
    - non-issuer cannot withdraw proceeds
    - withdrawProceeds with zero balance reverts
    - invariant: sale ETH balance equals tokens sold times priceWei minus withdrawals

  AssetToken
    - deploys with correct name, symbol, decimals, and supply
    - mints initial supply to issuer
    - issuer is auto-whitelisted on deployment
    - issuer can add an address to the whitelist
    - non-issuer cannot add to whitelist
    - issuer can remove a zero-balance address from whitelist
    - issuer cannot remove an address that still holds tokens
    - transfer to non-whitelisted address reverts
    - transfer from whitelisted to whitelisted succeeds
    - issuer can pause; all transfers revert while paused
    - issuer can unpause; transfers succeed again
    - non-issuer cannot pause
    - issuer can freeze an address; that address cannot send tokens
    - frozen address cannot receive tokens via transfer
    - issuer can unfreeze
    - issuer can forcedTransfer from a frozen address to a whitelisted address
    - non-issuer cannot call forcedTransfer
    - invariant: every holder is whitelisted (supply invariant)
    - invariant: totalSupply equals sum of all balances


